---
// "Our story / Built on experience and determination" — 4-card attorney grid
---

<section class="bg-surface py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center max-w-[800px] mx-auto mb-10">
      <p class="text-[14px] text-primary font-medium mb-3">Our story</p>
      <h2 class="text-[36px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-foreground mb-4" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">
        Built on experience and determination
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-muted-foreground">
        For decades, Logeman & Iafrate has represented injured clients across Michigan with unwavering commitment. We take cases others won't, and we win cases others can't. Our founders built this firm on a simple principle: injured people deserve fierce advocacy and real results.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <!-- Adrienne Logeman -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden border border-black/5 flex flex-col hover-lift">
        <img
          src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/881ce63c/images/693a55d51fbe67b78602b72b_EV3A7457-Enhanced-NR-1536.webp"
          alt="Adrienne Logeman"
          class="w-full h-[280px] object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-1">
          <p class="text-[13px] text-primary font-medium mb-1">Partner</p>
          <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold mb-3 text-foreground" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Adrienne Logeman</h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-[1.6] mb-4 flex-1">
            Ms. Logeman is a practicing lawyer since 2002 in Ann Arbor, Michigan. She received her bachelors from University of Michigan in bio-psychology/neuroscience. She received her law degree from Michigan State Law School. She also served on the Board of Directors for Eversight and volunteers with Donate for Life...
          </p>
          <a href="/attorney/adrienne-d-logeman" class="text-primary font-medium text-[14px] hover:underline">Learn more &gt;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Verdicts & Settlements -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden border border-black/5 flex flex-col hover-lift">
        <img
          src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/881ce63c/images/693497142d3f9984e2edc6a5_relume-608159-1024.webp"
          alt="Verdicts & Settlements"
          class="w-full h-[280px] object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-1">
          <p class="text-[13px] text-primary font-medium mb-1">We are fierce advocates</p>
          <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold mb-3 text-foreground" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Our Verdicts &amp; Settlements</h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-[1.6] mb-4 flex-1">
            For over forty-five years lawyers at our personal injury law firm have helped accident victims recover the compensation they need to rebuild their lives and take care of their families. Our attorneys are highly experienced and supported by well-trained staff...
          </p>
          <a href="/verdicts-and-settlements" class="text-primary font-medium text-[14px] hover:underline">Learn more &gt;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Reviews -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden border border-black/5 flex flex-col hover-lift">
        <img
          src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/881ce63c/images/693ae3bfbd437f799d63087e_0-1024.webp"
          alt="Highly Respected and Rated"
          class="w-full h-[280px] object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-1">
          <p class="text-[13px] text-primary font-medium mb-1">We are fierce trial ready advocates</p>
          <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold mb-3 text-foreground" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">Highly Respected and Rated</h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-[1.6] mb-4 flex-1">
            We have worked hard to earn the respect and gratitude of our clients. We are so grateful when they take the time to share their experience with us by leaving a review. Thank you to all those who did.
          </p>
          <a href="/client-testimonials" class="text-primary font-medium text-[14px] hover:underline">See Our Reviews &gt;</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- James A. Iafrate -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden border border-black/5 flex flex-col hover-lift">
        <img
          src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/881ce63c/images/693a53edf7b9715e7b7f58e3_james-a-iafrate-bio-photo-1024.webp"
          alt="James A. Iafrate"
          class="w-full h-[280px] object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-1">
          <p class="text-[13px] text-primary font-medium mb-1">Partner</p>
          <h3 class="text-[20px] font-bold mb-3 text-foreground" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">James A. Iafrate</h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-muted-foreground leading-[1.6] mb-4 flex-1">
            Licensed to practice law in Michigan since 1989, attorney James A. Iafrate has been serving clients at the Logeman & Iafrate, P.C., in Ann Arbor, Michigan, for the last 36 years. Over these years, he has built a commendable legal career focusing on a variety of personal injury cases...
          </p>
          <a href="/attorney/james-a-iafrate" class="text-primary font-medium text-[14px] hover:underline">Learn more &gt;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
